{"id":"u-755a32a2-23af-409e-bad5-0c8207d34db3","src":"community","title":"🦍Gorilla Hybrid 2.0","author":"M. S.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/G2kUgw-gorilla-hybrid-20","desc":"The **Gorilla Strength Workout Plan** is designed to build raw, functional, and total-body power — focusing on primal movements that engage the legs, back, core, and grip together. Its purpose is to develop **real-world usable strength**, not just muscle size, through heavy compound lifts, carries, and static holds that mimic how a gorilla moves — strong, stable, and explosive. This style of training enhances **grip strength, core stability, posture, and athletic endurance**, giving you a thicker, denser, and more powerful physique built on control and brute force rather than isolated muscle work.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":10,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:46:21.369Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper Power(Gorilla Strength)","Lower Power (Quads/Hams/Grip)","Overhead & Pull Strength","Lower Strength(Posterior Focus","Chest Symmetry + Delts","Power & Conditioning (Gorilla"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"x":5}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":7.5,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":7.5,"x":4}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Farmer's Walk (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":20,"rpe":8,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":8,"x":5}],"note":"Sit hips back\r\nChest tall"},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":4}],"note":"Hips back, soft knees\r\nStretch hamstrings fully"},{"n":"Walking Lunge","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"Keep torso upright\r\nKnee tracking foot"},{"n":"Leg Press (45 Degrees)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"Controlled motion\r\nAv